+# TH14 界面 Oracle
+
+使用日文 1.00b 的原版 `th14.exe`、启用 SDL3 的 Emscripten SDK、Node.js 和安装了 Unicorn 的 Python。先用当前源码构建 GLES Runtime，再用同一构建的游戏对象运行对照。
+
+```sh
+python -m pip install unicorn
+python tools/th14-build-gles.py --emsdk /path/to/emsdk --out artifacts/th14-ui
+python tools/th14-ui-oracle.py --exe /path/to/th14.exe --emsdk /path/to/emsdk --build artifacts/th14-ui --report artifacts/th14-ui/oracle.json
+```
+
+Oracle 执行原版暂停截图矩形、曲线激光顶点、位图四边形和续关次数初始化，并读取原版菜单音效调用与 WAV 映射。位图对照为两边提供相同的各分辨率素材尺寸，验证位置缩放不会再次放大位图。实际字库的选择由 [ANM VM Oracle](TH14_ANM_VM_ORACLE.md) 验证。曲线激光在两边使用同一中间画面坐标原点。候选侧还验证旧配置中的各个显示模式在网页里都使用 1280×960。
+
+对照使用受控的菜单状态、几何和截图接口。浏览器像素、纹理采样和实际 PCM 需要在游戏内验证。出现差异时命令返回非零退出码，JSON 同时保留原版预期和候选输出。
diff --git a/runtimes/th12/portable/sdl/FrameCadence.hpp b/runtimes/th12/portable/sdl/FrameCadence.hpp
index a53fbc3b90b344febae9e9b81619c0ea548eae9c..4591ba821d7f94647dfd9dc3b065a2c508066d29 100644
--- a/runtimes/th12/portable/sdl/FrameCadence.hpp
+++ b/runtimes/th12/portable/sdl/FrameCadence.hpp
@@ -11,12 +11,23 @@ struct FrameCadence {
     // Retail46a720 advances expired deadlines without replaying their outer
     // update/draw chains. Host display opportunities still own the polling.
     FrameDispatchTh14 dispatch;
-    double now=0;
-    void reset(){now=0;dispatch.reset();}
+    double now=0,display_debt=0;
+    void reset(){now=display_debt=0;dispatch.reset();}
     unsigned advance(double seconds){
         now+=seconds;
         return dispatch.begin(now,false).update?1u:0u;
     }
+    unsigned advance_display(double seconds,bool stable_gameplay){
+        if(!std::isfinite(seconds)||seconds<0){display_debt=0;return 0;}
+        // Retain the fractional time across RAF jitter. A small early
+        // update is paid back from the next interval, including at 120 Hz.
+        display_debt=std::min(2*interval,display_debt+seconds);
+        const auto due=unsigned(std::floor(std::max(0.,display_debt+.00125)/interval));
+        display_debt-=due*interval;
+        // The original update policy remains for loading and menus. Only
+        // steady play may take one extra update after a missed refresh.
+        return stable_gameplay?due:std::min(1u,due);
+    }
 #else
     // Other titles retain their existing bounded catch-up policy.
     double debt=0;
